\f1\b \kerning1\expnd7\expndtw37
how will the earvana app help relieve my tinnitus ringing?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd7\expndtw37
\
the easiest and quickest way to get tinnitus relief is by \'91masking\'92, which is to apply an EXTERNAL sound to overshadow (mask) the INTERNAL ringing.  \
\
traditional approaches often use WHITE NOISE, which is a blast of all sound frequencies simultaneously.  while this can be effective in masking internal auditory ringing, the sound of white noise itself is known to increase stress and agitation, and is not particularly pleasant.\
\
the earvana method replaces your internal ringing with audio that is not only pleasing to the ear, but calming to the mind;  the experience of being outdoors, in nature.\
\
but these are not just nature recordings. \
\
the earvana audio suite features rich soundtracks, digitally mastered with an unprecedented spatial realism.  the result is an audio \'91experience\'92 that so closely mimics the real thing, your brain will release the same neurotransmitters	 as if you are - in fact - standing on the coastal rocks as the waves lap beneath you, or at the edge of a mountain spring.  you can almost smell the fresh air.\
\
and it doesn\'92t stop there.\
\
these earvana soundscapes are selected and tailored for optimum tinnitus masking, with a unique added layer of treated audio targeting the most common tinnitus frequency bands.\
\
in simple terms, all of the earvana soundscapes not only can mask your internal ringing, but they will instantly calm you and nurture you with an audio experience you will want every day.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd7\expndtw37
my ringing is a constant high-pitch squeal. which earvana soundscapes will work best?\
